    "describe_ch": "是指導教授與學生透過討論，針對學生未來研究方向，由指導教授開列修課科目清單，以補強學生尚缺之先備知識。",
    "describe_eh": "The independent study(2) course is design for the supervisor to enhance the students \r\ncapability which of.........\r\n",
